{"id":"antiguo","lemma":"antiguo","pos":"adj","rank":1264,"glosses":["old, former, erstwhile, quondam, one-time, onetime","old, ancient, age-old","vintage, antique"],"ipa":"/anˈtiɡwo/","forms":{"feminine":"antigua","masculinePlural":"antiguos","femininePlural":"antiguas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cf/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-antiguo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Esta canción me recuerda a un antiguo conocido.","en":"This song reminds me of someone I used to know.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611676","words":[{"g":"this","l":"este"},{"g":"song"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to remember","l":"recordar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"known"}]},{"text":"Estoy viendo una película antigua.","en":"I am watching an old film.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639975","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to see, to spot","l":"ver"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"film"},null]},{"text":"Este es un libro antiguo.","en":"This book is old.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/799944","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"book"},null]},{"text":"Me gustan los libros antiguos.","en":"I love old books.","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to like in a general…","l":"gustar"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"book","l":"libro"},null]},{"text":"Todavía prefiero hacerlo a la antigua.","en":"I still prefer doing this the old way.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/300117","words":[{"g":"still, yet"},{"g":"to prefer","l":"preferir"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}